    <!--
        AND-112 — representative locale catalog ported from the web reference
        (reference/src/i18n/locales/{en,es,fr}.json). These shared, cross-feature strings live in
        :core-ui so every feature module resolves them through the platform resolver and the typed
        accessors in com.testlogon.android.core.ui.i18n (AND-111). Keys map the web's flat dotted
        i18next keys (e.g. "common.save") to Android snake_case resource names (i18n_common_save)
        so the converter mapping stays deterministic. Default (en) here; values-es/ holds Spanish;
        any key missing from a translated catalog falls back to this default (Android resource
        fallback) — never an empty string or the raw key (AND-112 FR-3). -->

